 It was released on July 24, 2014 for iOS, Android, Windows Phone 8, Windows 8.1 and BlackBerry 10, on October 24, 2018 for Windows via Steam, and for Nintendo Switch on February 14, 2019. It is the first game in the series that is developed by Gameloft Bucharest, the previous installments were developed by Gameloft Montreal.","title":"Modern Combat 5: Blackout","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Modern_Combat_5%3A_Blackout","asOf":"2026-11-21"},"ar":{"text":"موديرن كومبات 5: بلاك آوت هي لعبة فيديو من منظور الشخص الأول تم تطويرها ونشرها بواسطة شركة غيم لوفت لأنظمة أندرويد وآي أو أس وويندوز فون وبلاك بيري 10 وويندوز 8.1 وتايزن. تعدّ اللعبة الجزء الخامس من سلسلة موديرن كومبات سبقتها لعبة موديرن كومبات 4: زيرو آور وتعدّ من افضل الالعاب في وقتها بين عامي 2015-2017.","title":"موديرن كومبات 5: بلاك آوت","url":"https://ar.wikipedia.org/wiki/%D9%85%D9%88%D8%AF%D9%8A%D8%B1%D9%86_%D9%83%D9%88%D9%85%D8%A8%D8%A7%D8%AA_5%3A_%D8%A8%D9%84%D8%A7%D9%83_%D8%A2%D9%88%D8%AA","asOf":"2026-11-21"}}},"monument-builders-rushmore-switch":{"id":"monument-builders-rushmore-switch","developers":[],"opencriticId":"7392"},"mosaic-switch":{"id":"mosaic-switch","developers":["Krillbite Studio"],"opencriticId":"8689"},"munchkin-switch":{"id":"munchkin-switch","developers":[],"opencriticId":"8646"},"my-time-at-portia-switch":{"id":"my-time-at-portia-switch","developers":["Pathea Games"],"series":["My Time"],"opencriticId":"7174"},"nexomon-plus-nexomon-extinction-complete-collection-switch":{"id":"nexomon-plus-nexomon-extinction-complete-collection-switch","developers":["Vewo Interactive"],"series":["Nexomon"]},"niche-a-genetics-survival-game-switch":{"id":"niche-a-genetics-survival-game-switch","developers":["Stray Fawn Studio"],"opencriticId":"10099"},"nine-witches-family-disruption-switch":{"id":"nine-witches-family-disruption-switch","developers":[],"opencriticId":"10635"},"northgard-switch":{"id":"northgard-switch","developers":["Shiro Games"],"opencriticId":"5704"},"nurse-love-addiction-switc